  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Construction — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level, you have refined your technique to the maximum point, now gaining your domain expansion. While inside your domain, you can now create any of your items by spending no cursed energy. All of these items will deal two additional damage dice and attacks made with them cannot miss. However, these weapons will only last until the end of the domain.</p>",
